              </div>
              <figcaption class="figure-caption">Same fault, two distances. Only the one along the traced route leads to the spot the pinpointer is listening for.</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <dl class="method-facts">
                <div><dt>What you measure</dt><dd>The cable&rsquo;s path at the surface, and on most receivers its depth.</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Typical pitfall</dt><dd>Pacing the distance in a straight line, or along the kerb instead of above the cable.</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Instruments</dt><dd>
                  <ul class="station__products">
                    <li><a href="/products/crt-015-cable-route-tracer"><span class="station__model">CRT-015</span> <span class="station__pname">Cable route tracer</span></a></li>
